<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Calculadora de Megaenergia | Pokémon GO</title>
<style>
:root{font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;color:#eaf0ff;background:#0b1220}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.app{width:min(100%,510px);background:#172238;border:1px solid #2c3b55;border-radius:24px;padding:28px;box-shadow:0 24px 70px #0005}h1{font-size:1.65rem;margin:0 0 6px}p{color:#aebdd3;margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.5}.fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.wide{grid-column:1/-1}label{font-size:.87rem;color:#c9d6eb;font-weight:600}input,select{width:100%;background:#0e182a;border:1px solid #40506c;border-radius:12px;color:#fff;padding:13px;font:inherit;outline:none}input:focus,select:focus{border-color:#65d4ff}select option{background:#0e182a}input[type=range]{padding:0;accent-color:#76f0c1;cursor:pointer}.slider-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#aebdd3;font-size:.82rem}.slider-labels span{width:25%;text-align:center}.slider-labels span:first-child{text-align:left}.slider-labels span:last-child{text-align:right}.selected{color:#76f0c1;font-weight:800}.result{margin-top:23px;padding:22px;border-radius:17px;background:#102c35;border:1px solid #285965}.eyebrow{font-size:.82rem;color:#a4d9d6;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em}.km{font-size:3rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:4px 0;color:#76f0c1}.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:15px}.stat{background:#183e47;border-radius:11px;padding:12px}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:1.25rem}.stat span{font-size:.8rem;color:#b5d5d8}.track{height:10px;border-radius:20px;background:#31435c;overflow:hidden;margin-top:17px}.bar{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5ec8fa,#72f0bf);width:0%;transition:width .2s}.progress{font-size:.83rem;color:#b7c6dc;margin-top:7px}.note{font-size:.82rem;color:#9eafc8;margin-top:17px;line-height:1.5}button{margin-top:18px;border:1px solid #40506c;background:transparent;color:#d6e3f5;padding:10px 15px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}button:hover{background:#263752}@media(max-width:440px){.app{padding:20px}.km{font-size:2.5rem}}
</style>
</head>
<body><main class="app"><h1>⚡ Calculadora de Megaenergia</h1><p>Calcule a distância necessária para chegar a 5.000 Megaenergias. Ganho de 5 energias por km.</p>
<div class="fields"><div class="field wide"><label for="atual">Megaenergia que já tenho</label><input id="atual" type="number" min="0" max="5000" step="1" value="0"></div><div class="field wide"><label for="dist">Distância para receber energia: <span class="selected" id="distValor">1 km</span></label><input id="dist" type="range" min="0" max="3" step="1" value="0"><div class="slider-labels"><span>1 km</span><span>3 km</span><span>5 km</span><span>20 km</span></div></div></div>
<section class="result" aria-live="polite"><div class="eyebrow">Distância necessária</div><div class="km" id="km">1.000 km</div><div class="stats"><div class="stat"><strong id="faltam">5.000</strong><span>Megaenergias faltantes</span></div><div class="stat"><strong id="vezes">1.000</strong><span>Recompensas necessárias</span></div></div><div class="track"><div class="bar" id="bar"></div></div><div class="progress" id="progresso">0% da meta alcançada</div></section>
<div class="note" id="nota">O resultado considera apenas recompensas completas, sem bônus adicionais.</div><button type="button" id="reset">Restaurar valores</button></main>
<script>
const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),format=n=>new Intl.NumberFormat('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:2}).format(n);
const distancias=[1,3,5,20],meta=5000;
function calc(){const atual=Number($('atual').value),dist=distancias[Number($('dist').value)];$('distValor').textContent=dist+' km';if(!Number.isFinite(atual)||atual<0){$('km').textContent='—';$('faltam').textContent='—';$('vezes').textContent='—';$('progresso').textContent='Confira a energia atual';$('bar').style.width='0%';return;}const faltam=Math.max(0,Math.ceil(meta-atual)),energia=dist*5,vezes=Math.ceil(faltam/energia),km=vezes*dist,percent=Math.min(100,atual/meta*100);$('km').textContent=format(km)+' km';$('faltam').textContent=format(faltam);$('vezes').textContent=format(vezes);$('bar').style.width=percent+'%';$('progresso').textContent=format(percent)+'% da meta alcançada';$('nota').textContent=faltam===0?'Meta alcançada! Você já tem energia suficiente.':`A cada ${format(dist)} km, você recebe ${format(energia)} Megaenergias. O cálculo considera recompensas completas, sem bônus adicionais.`}
['atual','dist'].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener('input',calc));$('reset').addEventListener('click',()=>{$('atual').value=0;$('dist').value=0;calc()});calc();
</script></body></html>
